  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "This genus-level Arthropleura has a long low body, wide lateral plates and numerous short legs. Adult proportions and colour are estimated; head details from juvenile fossils do not establish identical proportions in giant adults.",
    "zh": "此属级节胸蜈蚣 Arthropleura 具有低矮长躯干、宽侧板和众多短足。成年比例和颜色为估计；幼体化石中的头部细节不能证明巨型成年个体具有相同比例。"
  },
